<Layout title="Admissions Coaching & Mentorship" description="Thoughtful admissions coaching and academic mentorship with Wharton Chan. Application strategy, personal statements, interview preparation, and guided academic exploration.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="03 / Education & Direction" title="Find your direction.<br />Make it your own." description="Thoughtful admissions coaching and academic mentorship. For applications with a clear voice, and educational choices made with understanding." />
  <div class="container">
    <section class="split-content"><h2>A considered approach.</h2><div><p>Wharton brings approximately ten years of admissions consulting experience through two consulting companies, alongside his own education at Oxford and Duke-NUS.</p><p>His approach combines live consultations with asynchronous feedback. With a maximum of five active clients per month, the work stays focused, personal, and grounded in the applicant's own ideas.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admissions/process/">Beyond admissions: the philosophy <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></a></div></section>
    <div class="offering-grid"><section class="offering"><span class="eyebrow">01 / The application ahead</span><h2>Admissions Coaching</h2><p>A premium, time-bounded service for applicants approaching or already in an application cycle. Develop your strategy, articulate your experiences, and prepare for interviews.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admissions/coaching/">Explore admissions coaching <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></a></section><section class="offering"><span class="eyebrow">02 / The possibilities ahead</span><h2>Academic Mentorship</h2><p>A more accessible, longer-term relationship for students exploring academic interests and educational directions. Build understanding before making commitments.</p><a class="text-link" href="/admissions/mentorship/">Explore academic mentorship <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></a></section></div>
    <section class="split-content"><h2>Your work.<br />Your voice.</h2><div><p>No admissions guarantees. No ghostwriting. No fabricated experiences. Applicant information is handled confidentially, and the work remains the applicant's own.</p><p>Prices are generally provided upon enquiry. Scope, editing, and asynchronous feedback are agreed before any payment.</p><a class="button" href="/admissions/book/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13L13 3M3 3H13V13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" /></svg></span></a></div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
